      "content": "<p>Bangalore's title of the <b>Silicon Valley of India</b> has resulted in a huge increase in suburban complexes, each trying to provide the highest standards of living. Whitefield and Sarjapur are among the most popular ones and are strong contenders. Whether you want to invest or settle down, it is important to pick a suburb according to your needs.<br></p><h2><b><br>Key Takeaways:</b></h2><ul><li>Whitefield is a mature suburb with robust infrastructure and connectivity.<br></li><li>Sarjapur is fast growing, providing cheap housing and upcoming potential.<br></li><li>Both suburbs assure development and excellent living, being responsive to all needs.<br></li></ul><p></p><h3><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Whitefield Overview</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqlbhb5b4x63w\",\"id\":\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\"> </span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqlbhb5b4x63w\",\"id\":\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\"><b> </b><br></span></h3><h4><br>History and Development</h4><p></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocqlbhb5b4x63w\",\"id\":\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xltffjnhrp72\"></span></p><p>Situated in the eastern Bangalore, Whitefield is highly connected via major, and it is an important residential and commercial hub. It was founded in 1882 as a settlemenroadwayst for Anglo-Indians and Eurasians and was a quiet place until the IT boom in the late 1990s turned it into a prominent area.</p><p style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"></p><h4><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Key Features</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocz6dupw22lcrw\",\"id\":\"toc_f99pfj0y6rar\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_f99pfj0y6rar\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocz6dupw22lcrw\",\"id\":\"toc_f99pfj0y6rar\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_f99pfj0y6rar\"> </span></h4><p></p><p style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"></p><ul></ul><p></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>IT clusters:</b> They have lots of multinational giants, and prestige technology parks.<br></span></li><li><b>Lifestyle</b>: Abundant with malls, restaurants, and recreational spaces.</li><li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Connectivity</b>: Well connected with Namma Metro's Purple Line and major roads.<br></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Property Trends:</b>The  price of properties ranges between ₹6,000 to ₹15,000 per sq. ft., depending on location and type of accommodation.</span></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur Overview</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3pm8n3weay0c\",\"id\":\"toc_ox22labrh0tm\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ox22labrh0tm\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3pm8n3weay0c\",\"id\":\"toc_ox22labrh0tm\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ox22labrh0tm\"> </span></b></h3><h4 style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Emerging Potential</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toceeso7pzxdonw\",\"id\":\"toc_o10lrx8ruinr\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_o10lrx8ruinr\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toceeso7pzxdonw\",\"id\":\"toc_o10lrx8ruinr\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_o10lrx8ruinr\"> </span></h4><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\">Located in Southeast Bangalore, Sarjapur Road has undergone a swift metamorphosis into a bustling real estate hub. Famous for housing huge tech parks and having proximity to large IT hubs such as Electronic City and Outer Ring Road, it has emerged as a hub for professionals and families alike.</p><h4 style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Key Features</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocfh843agjl2bq\",\"id\":\"toc_cr7cl32e3wkh\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_cr7cl32e3wkh\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocfh843agjl2bq\",\"id\":\"toc_cr7cl32e3wkh\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_cr7cl32e3wkh\"> </span></h4><ul data-list-id=\"17840335\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial;\"><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"17840335\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"17840335\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Education:</b></span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Prestigious international schools such as Greenwood High , Indus International,Orchids – The International School, Delhi Public School</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"17840335\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"17840335\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Residential Projects:</b></span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"> High-rise apartments and villas at competitive rates.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"17840335\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"17840335\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Connectivity:</b></span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b> </b> Future Namma Metro Phase 3 and improved road networks.</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Property Trends</b>:</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"> Average property rates range between ₹4,000 and ₹10,000 per sq. ft., making it more affordable than Whitefield.</span></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
