      "content": "<p></p><p></p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Connectivity and Infrastructure</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyxw8eyuzfr8o\",\"id\":\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\">&nbsp;</span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyxw8eyuzfr8o\",\"id\":\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\"><b>&nbsp;</b><br></span></h2><h3><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyxw8eyuzfr8o\",\"id\":\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_n7eg6f3tmzw7\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><br>Whitefield</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc3fm49e5s26zl\",\"id\":\"toc_bqe43essqkuc\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_bqe43essqkuc\">&nbsp;<br></span></span></h3><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Road Connectivity</b>: Well connected by Whitefield Road, Old Airport Road, and the Outer Ring Road (ORR).<br></span><b>Metro Connectivit</b>y:Whitefield is connected to Baiyyappanahalli through the Purple Line extension, improving intra-city travel.<br><b>Public Transport</b>:BMTC buses are well-connected, making it easy to commute within Bangalore.<br></p><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></p><h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur</span></h3><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Road Connectivity</b>: Connects to Koramangala, HSR Layout, and IT parks such as Electronic City and ORR.<br></span><p><b>Metro Connectivity</b>: Planned lines, such as the Hebbal-Sarjapur line and&nbsp;ongoing ORR-Airport line of Namma Metro&nbsp;will enhance connectivity to other areas of the city.</p><p><b>Public Transport</b>:&nbsp;<span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Dependent mainly on road transport, with the upcoming metro.</span></p><br><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Suburb</b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></span></p></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Metro Status</b></span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Road Quality</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Whitefield</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Operational (Purple Line)</span></td><td><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Established routes</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Sarjapur</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Planned (Phase 3)</span></td><td><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000979011\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Developing routes</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Lifestyle and Amenities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgbbumu1lzqy\",\"id\":\"toc_jcidia4d2ucb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_jcidia4d2ucb\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocjgbbumu1lzqy\",\"id\":\"toc_jcidia4d2ucb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_jcidia4d2ucb\">&nbsp;</span></b></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Schools</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc1uiljurbdtrq\",\"id\":\"toc_2j7mbzs464mp\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_2j7mbzs464mp\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc1uiljurbdtrq\",\"id\":\"toc_2j7mbzs464mp\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_2j7mbzs464mp\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Both suburbs offer top-notch educational institutions, making them ideal for families.</span></p><ul data-list-id=\"91019456\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial;\"><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"0pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles