e apartments and luxury villas, attracting a variety of rentors.<br>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Expected ROI:</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"> Whitefield has delivered an annual property appreciation of </span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">8–10%</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"> in the last decade.</span></p><h4 style=\"margin: 15.96pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocb1supr94b0b2\",\"id\":\"toc_xk6tov5ifesl\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xk6tov5ifesl\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocb1supr94b0b2\",\"id\":\"toc_xk6tov5ifesl\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xk6tov5ifesl\">&nbsp;</span></h4><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochiuv0fyqf5z8\",\"id\":\"toc_4rj0q24etmsb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_4rj0q24etmsb\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Sarjapur is a potential growth area. The prices of the properties in the region are low, which makes it attractive to first-time homebuyers. Since the Namma Metro will be extending and there are new IT parks in development, investors can expect higher returns in the years to come. <br>Future ROI: Sarjapur properties have registered a mid-growth rate of 5–7%, but the trend is increasing.<br></span></span></p><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochiuv0fyqf5z8\",\"id\":\"toc_4rj0q24etmsb\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-